Package: postfix-report
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Francesco Defilippo <francesco@defilippo.org>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: passwd
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/fdefilippo/postfix-report
Description: Postfix statistics with SQLite history and static HTML reports
 postfix-report reads the Postfix logs (rotated or gzip-compressed too),
 keeps the history in a SQLite database and writes static HTML reports
 (daily, ISO weekly, monthly, yearly) that work from any static web server
 or file://. Import is incremental and idempotent; log coverage is stated
 explicitly, so missing data is never shown as zero. A systemd timer
 updates the reports every hour.
